  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-FORB-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh, good, split up in the Forbidden City. I don't see how that could possibly go wrong.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Baba_Yaga_AH-FORB_124.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752243,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-FORB-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We're hammering in the dark at any rate until we find out what those places are.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ignus_Ferric_AH-FORB_072.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752282,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-FORB-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Well, obviously they're this city, but in ages past. Knowing which ages might help us a bit, but Miranda's labels do not.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Baba_Yaga_AH-FORB_125.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752243,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-FORB-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "These Eldritch symbols could though, if we could translate them.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Baba_Yaga_AH-FORB_126.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752243,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-FORB-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Didya not figure that out already?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ignus_Ferric_AH-FORB_073.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752282,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-FORB-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Maybe. But language has a way of drifting over time, softening, changing. Or we just learned the Triton language the Eldritch used in their infancy.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Baba_Yaga_AH-FORB_127.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752243,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-FORB-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If we can find examples of these three symbols in context, Myth Photomancy can help you understand them. Look around.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Baba_Yaga_AH-FORB_128.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752243,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-FORB-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Find Libraries, Schools or Galleries, maybe you'll find them written somewhere.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Baba_Yaga_AH-FORB_129.mp3",
